                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pleasantly surprised !\n\nAt first I was a little afraid of the \"Rubik's cube\" appearance  of the game cause it traumatized me during my childhood.\nI never managed to make a complete cube..It's frustrating.\n\nBut then CubiKolor reconciles me with cubes. For a puzzle game I havent been blocked yet but I feel I have fought like a demon to get my cube to the right place at the right time!\n\nI havent rage quit yet...really encouraging !",
